<title>USA: E.W. Scripps Co Q2 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>E.W. Scripps Co Q2 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oper Shr			  $0.48		    $0.39</p>
<p> Oper Net			 38,579		   31,708</p>
<p> Revs			    305,512		  277,324</p>
<p> Avg shrs			 80,970		   80,308</p>
<p>			     6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper Shr			  $0.85		    $0.64</p>
<p> Oper Net			 68,602		   51,428</p>
<p> Revs			    596,222		  531,569</p>
<p> Avg shrs			 80,937		   80,256</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Q2 net shr $0.48 vs $0.52.</p>
<p>Q2 '96 excludes after-tax charge $2.6 million, or $0.03 shr, from restructuring at Cincinnati joint operating agency.</p>
<p>Q2 '96 excludes gain $12.8 million from Scripps Cable discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Q2 newspapers oper net $42.2 million vs $35.2 million.</p>
<p>Q2 broadcast oper net $32.1 million vs $30 million.</p>
</text>
